{"id":"G2896","lemma":"κράζω","transliteration":"krazō","sayIt":"krazō","language":"Greek","partOfSpeech":"verb","gloss":"to cry","meaning":"κράζω\n[in LXX for זָעַק, צָעַק, קָרָא, etc. ;]\nin cl. chiefly poët.,\n1. prop. onomatop., of the raven, to croak, hence generally, of inartic. cries, to scream, cry out (Æsch., al.): Mrk.5:5 9:26 15:39 (Rec., R, mg.), Luk.9:39, al.; of crying for vengeance (cf. Gen.4:10), Jas.5:4.\n2. to cry, call out with a loud voice: with accusative of thing(s), Act.19:32; before orat. dir., Mrk.10:48, Luk.18:39, al.; (ἐν) φωνῇ μεγάλῃ, Mrk.5:7, Rev.14:15, al.; λέγων, Mat.8:29, al.; of public teaching, Jhn.1:15, Rom.9:27, al.; of importunate prayer (cf. Job.35:12, Psa.3:5, al.), Rom.8:15, Gal.4:6; pf. with Pres. sense (vernac.; M, Pr., 147), Jhn.1:15\nSYN.: see: βοάω (AS)","glosses":["cried out","crying out","shouting","shouted","cry out","called out"],"count":54,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"mat-8","v":29,"renderings":{"bsb":"they shouted","kjv":"they cried out"}},{"chapterId":"mat-9","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"crying out","kjv":"crying"}},{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"cried out","kjv":"they cried out"}},{"chapterId":"mat-14","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"cried out","kjv":"he cried"}},{"chapterId":"mat-15","v":22,"renderings":{"bsb":"crying out"}},{"chapterId":"mat-15","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"she keeps crying out","kjv":"she crieth"}},{"chapterId":"mat-20","v":30,"renderings":{"bsb":"they cried out","kjv":"cried out"}},{"chapterId":"mat-20","v":31,"renderings":{"bsb":"they cried out","kjv":"they cried"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":9,"renderings":{"bsb":"were shouting","kjv":"cried"}},{"chapterId":"mat-21","v":15,"renderings":{"bsb":"shouting","kjv":"crying"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"they shouted","kjv":"they cried out"}},{"chapterId":"mat-27","v":50,"renderings":{"bsb":"had cried out","kjv":"hen he had cried"}},{"chapterId":"mrk-3","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"cried out","kjv":"cried"}},{"chapt