f":"Acts 7:57","note":"But they cried out with a loud voice and stopped their ears, then rushed at him with one accord.","source":"web"},{"ref":"Romans 8:15","note":"For you didn’t receive the spirit of bondage again to fear, but you received the Spirit of adoption, by whom we cry, “Abba! Father!”","source":"web"},{"ref":"Galatians 4:6","note":"And because you are children, God sent out the Spirit of his Son into your hearts, crying, “Abba, Father!”","source":"web"},{"ref":"James 5:4","note":"Behold, the wages of the laborers who mowed your fields, which you have kept back by fraud, cry out, and the cries of those who reaped have entered into the…","source":"web"}],"related":[],"sources":["STEPBible TBESH/TBESG lexicon (CC BY 4.0)","STEPBible TAHOT/TAGNT tagged text (CC BY 4.0)"]}